# What never belongs in a build context.
#
# The source tree is small today, but ``agent/`` is the runtime data root: it
# grows with model caches, session databases and account uploads. Sending it
# to the daemon on every build would be slow at best and would put a user's
# data into an image layer at worst.
.git
agent/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/test_*.py
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
engineering/
01_src/experiments/
01_src/test_delivery/
01_src/src/prompts/builds/
01_src/src/prompts/snapshots/
_archive/
_backups/
_backup_20261030/
_scratch/
*.onnx
*.tif
*.tiff
